cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "somascan-qc: reproducible QC and filtering for SomaScan ADAT data"
abstract: >-
  A command-line pipeline that converts an ANML-normalized SomaLogic SomaScan ADAT
  file into an analysis-ready protein x sample matrix with per-sample and per-analyte
  quality control, blank-based detectability filtering, a self-contained HTML QC
  report and a checksum-bearing run manifest.
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/ORG/somascan-qc"
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - SomaScan
  - SomaLogic
  - aptamer
  - quality control
  - reproducible research
